{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14875","headline":"和马郎中画鹤赞 · 卢纶","name":"和马郎中画鹤赞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高高华亭，有鹤在屏。\n削玉点漆，乘轩姓丁。\n暮云冥冥，双垂雪翎。\n晨光炯炯，一直朱顶。\n含音俨容，绝粒遗影。\n君以爲真，相期缑岭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14875.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14875","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}